    </rdf:Seq>
   </dc:creator>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">KUNAR PROVINCE, Afghanistan - U.S. Army Spc. Jesus B. Fernandez of San Jose, Calif., an assistant team leader with 3rd Platoon, Chosen Company, 2nd Battalion, 12th Infantry Regiment, 4th Brigade Combat Team, crosses a stream during a unit visit to Angla Kala village on Feb. 6. International Security Assistance Force troops regularly meet with village elders to improve communications between residents and government officials. (U.S. Army Photo by Staff Sgt. Gary A. Witte, 300th Mobile Public Affairs Detachment)</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
